    "group": "Plagueburst Crawler",
    "summary": "During your Shooting phase, when the Plagueburst mortar of this model is given a target, roll a D6 for the target and a D6 for every other enemy unit that is within 3\" of it, with +1 to the roll for an Afflicted unit. Any unit whose roll is 6+ is struck by spores. Once this model has resolved every attack it makes against the target, D3 mortal wounds are inflicted on every unit that was struck by spores.",
